    "q-159689": {
      "dom_id": "step-q159689",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Let $X=[{X}_{1},{X}_{2}]^{T}$ be a bivariate normal random vector. The variances of ${X}_{1}$ and ${X}_{2}$ and their covariance are given by\n\n$$\n{\\sigma }_{1}^{2}=10,\\,{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}=5,\\,{\\sigma }_{12}=5.\n$$\n\nGiven that the joint probability density function of $X$ is\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{1}{k}\\,exp(-\\frac{1}{2}(x-\\mu )^{T}\\,{Σ}^{-1}\\,(x-\\mu )),\n$$\n\nwhere $\\mu $ is the mean vector and $Σ$ is the corresponding covariance matrix, find the value of $k.$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that if $X=[{X}_{1},{X}_{2}]^{T}$ is a bivariate normal vector with mean vector $\\mu $ and covariance matrix $Σ,$ given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mu =(\\begin{aligned}{\\mu }_{1} \\\\ {\\mu }_{2}\\end{aligned}),\\,Σ=[\\begin{aligned}{\\sigma }_{1}^{2} & {\\sigma }_{12} \\\\ {\\sigma }_{21} & {\\sigma }_{2}^{2}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}{\\sigma }_{1}^{2} & \\rho {\\sigma }_{1}{\\sigma }_{2} \\\\ \\rho {\\sigma }_{1}{\\sigma }_{2} & {\\sigma }_{2}^{2}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${\\sigma }_{i}^{2}=\\text{Var}[{X}_{i}],$ ${\\sigma }_{12}=\\text{Cov}[{X}_{1},{X}_{2}],$ and $\\rho $ is the correlation, then the joint probability density function of $X$ is\n\n$$\nf({x}_{1},{x}_{2})=\\frac{1}{2\\pi \\sqrt{|Σ|}}exp(-\\frac{1}{2}(X-\\mu )^{T}\\,{Σ}^{-1}\\,(X-\\mu ))\n$$\n\nand $|Σ|$ denotes the determinant of $Σ.$\n\nUsing the given values of ${\\sigma }_{1}^{2},{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}$, and ${\\sigma }_{12},$ our covariance matrix is\n\n$$\nΣ=[\\begin{aligned}10 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n|Σ|=10\\cdot 5-5\\cdot 5=25.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this value into our expression for the joint PDF, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =\\frac{1}{2\\pi \\sqrt{25}}exp(-\\frac{1}{2}(x-\\mu )^{T}\\,{Σ}^{-1}\\,(x-\\mu )) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10\\pi }exp(-\\frac{1}{2}(x-\\mu )^{T}\\,{Σ}^{-1}\\,(x-\\mu )).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, $k=10\\pi .$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
